## 7. Test Verification Files
- `tests/test_sql_task.py`: Unit tests for `SqlTask` (answer extraction, prompt formatting, SQLite execution verification, and metrics).
- `tests/test_sql_reward.py`: Unit tests for `verl/recipe/sql/reward_function.py` (scoring, tag validation, hint penalty, and database verification).
